(1058992, 127890, 18197, '<td valign="top">I refuse to kill Woody with a 10; or wound him with a 9; or ...</td>', 'I refuse to kill Woody with a 10; or wound him with a 9; or ...', '2004-12-13 00:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058996, 127633, 28108, '<td valign="top">Very nice... Makes you wish you could see the breakpoint. Very nice soft lighting. I like the backdrop, works very well with the subject. I just wish I could see the breakpoint. An another little detail, since it looks so perfect from this angle (no discoloration, dryness, rips, etc.)... The leaf! I wish I could see it tilted a bit to see more shape. Besides those two things, I think it''s perfect. For me, to pay so much attention to the details of your picture, means it really striked me</td>', 'Very nice... Makes you wish you could see the breakpoint. Very nice soft lighting. I like the backdrop, works very well with the subject. I just wish I could see the breakpoint. An another little detail, since it looks so perfect from this angle (no discoloration, dryness, rips, etc.)... The leaf! I wish I could see it tilted a bit to see more shape. Besides those two things, I think it''s perfect. For me, to pay so much attention to the details of your picture, means it really striked me', '2004-12-13 00:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058999, 127597, 29477, '<td valign="top">Would have had more of an impact (to me) if you left the flag RW&amp;B.  I like the sky in the background but find the saturation of the flag will cause you some higher votes.  Still gave a 5 based on the composition (7 if flag was untouched).   Would like to see a copy with the flag untouched.</td>', 'Would have had more of an impact (to me) if you left the flag RW&B.  I like the sky in the background but find the saturation of the flag will cause you some higher votes.  Still gave a 5 based on the composition (7 if flag was untouched).   Would like to see a copy with the flag untouched.', '2004-12-13 00:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059005, 127948, 18197, '<td valign="top">Confused by the title.</td>', 'Confused by the title.', '2004-12-13 00:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059028, 127082, 30594, '<td valign="top">There i s a specific sense of sadness in this photograph -- the clarity emphasizes the mood of brokenhearted -- a strong sense of distress.</td>', 'There i s a specific sense of sadness in this photograph -- the clarity emphasizes the mood of brokenhearted -- a strong sense of distress.', '2004-12-13 01:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059031, 127948, 22479, '<td valign="top">OUCH!<br/> <br/>Tell me you can put this back together again? :)<br/> <br/>All the parts from this crop looks undamaged. However, I think this fits perfectly with the spirit of the challenge. Well done!<br/></td>', 'OUCH! Tell me you can put this back together again? :) All the parts from this crop looks undamaged. However, I think this fits perfectly with the spirit of the challenge. Well done!', '2004-12-13 01:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059038, 127919, 22479, '<td valign="top">Dark theme. She looks withdrawn, troubled, subdued. Your point is well taken.<br/> <br/>Technical: Love the low key + toning. Composed and framed well.</td>', 'Dark theme. She looks withdrawn, troubled, subdued. Your point is well taken. Technical: Love the low key + toning. Composed and framed well.', '2004-12-13 01:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059039, 128011, 16241, '<td valign="top">somehow i like this one a lot !</td>', 'somehow i like this one a lot !', '2004-12-13 01:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059042, 127630, 22479, '<td valign="top">Like the DOF. Clean presentation. I think the point is well conveyed.<br/> <br/>Technical: One comment: lighting a bit harsh from the right, but not enough to detract from the beauty and simplicity of this shot. Well done!</td>', 'Like the DOF. Clean presentation. I think the point is well conveyed. Technical: One comment: lighting a bit harsh from the right, but not enough to detract from the beauty and simplicity of this shot. Well done!', '2004-12-13 01:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059044, 127351, 22479, '<td valign="top">Broke the bank? :)<br/> <br/>Well within the spirit of this challenge. I like the artistic presentation as well. Is that my monitor playing tricks on me, or is that a smudge near the top edge and top-right edge? Yes, there are a couple of artifacts which detracts from the beauty of this shot. It''s subtle, but unfortunate. Still, just a minor issue. Good job!</td>', 'Broke the bank? :) Well within the spirit of this challenge. I like the artistic presentation as well. Is that my monitor playing tricks on me, or is that a smudge near the top edge and top-right edge? Yes, there are a couple of artifacts which detracts from the beauty of this shot. It''s subtle, but unfortunate. Still, just a minor issue. Good job!', '2004-12-13 01:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059046, 127644, 22479, '<td valign="top">The choice of color adds to the artistic presentation of this photograph. The crop and perspective adds much interest. Technically adequate in all aspects. Well done!</td>', 'The choice of color adds to the artistic presentation of this photograph. The crop and perspective adds much interest. Technically adequate in all aspects. Well done!', '2004-12-13 01:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059047, 127978, 22479, '<td valign="top">The bulb bashers at work again. :) Excellent stop motion. Fits the spirit of the challenge theme very nicely. Well done.</td>', 'The bulb bashers at work again. :) Excellent stop motion. Fits the spirit of the challenge theme very nicely. Well done.', '2004-12-13 01:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059048, 127625, 22479, '<td valign="top">Is that a chain link fence behind the owl? Creates an interesting bokeh. Good artistic presentation. Technically, the DOF appears to be just a hair shallow as evidenced by loss of detail in the talons. Minor points which do not detract significantly from the beauty of this image. Well done.</td>', 'Is that a chain link fence behind the owl? Creates an interesting bokeh. Good artistic presentation. Technically, the DOF appears to be just a hair shallow as evidenced by loss of detail in the talons. Minor points which do not detract significantly from the beauty of this image. Well done.', '2004-12-13 01:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059050, 127597, 22479, '<td valign="top">Bold entry. Palette shift creates a stark image which conveys your point nicely, albeit a dark theme.</td>', 'Bold entry. Palette shift creates a stark image which conveys your point nicely, albeit a dark theme.', '2004-12-13 01:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059052, 127065, 22479, '<td valign="top">Clever title! Artistic presentation is nice with the high contrast. Technically, chromatic aberration evident in the background. Doesn''t significantly detract from the beauty of this image. Overall this fits the spirit of the challenge theme.</td>', 'Clever title! Artistic presentation is nice with the high contrast. Technically, chromatic aberration evident in the background. Doesn''t significantly detract from the beauty of this image. Overall this fits the spirit of the challenge theme.', '2004-12-13 01:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059060, 127649, 29486, '<td valign="top">I am confused as to the meaning. Why the flies? The image is so-so.</td>', 'I am confused as to the meaning. Why the flies? The image is so-so.', '2004-12-13 01:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059061, 127987, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a tremendous abstract, I think you might have trouble for being a little too far out of the box, but I like this a lot. 9. <br/> <br/>Reminds me a lot of a certain "project slinky." (It''s a similar style of photo, and you''ve used the same border). Apologies if I have the photographer''s identity wrong. It''s a nine whoever you are.</td>', 'This is a tremendous abstract, I think you might have trouble for being a little too far out of the box, but I like this a lot. 9.  Reminds me a lot of a certain "project slinky." (It''s a similar style of photo, and you''ve used the same border). Apologies if I have the photographer''s identity wrong. It''s a nine whoever you are.', '2004-12-13 01:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059062, 127564, 29486, '<td valign="top">Interesting attempt. Overall a nice image but it doesn''t get any extra points because of it''s unrealistic spillage. I would have like to see the wine all over the table.</td>', 'Interesting attempt. Overall a nice image but it doesn''t get any extra points because of it''s unrealistic spillage. I would have like to see the wine all over the table.', '2004-12-13 01:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059063, 127374, 29486, '<td valign="top">Generally nice. The material it is laying on is a little too obvious.</td>', 'Generally nice. The material it is laying on is a little too obvious.', '2004-12-13 01:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059065, 126917, 29486, '<td valign="top">Would like to see the broken piece better illuminated</td>', 'Would like to see the broken piece better illuminated', '2004-12-13 01:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059067, 127560, 22479, '<td valign="top">Ah! Should have used "Broke" instead of "Broken". Excellent take on the challenge. I think this fits within the spirit of the challenge theme.  Technically without flaws and tastefully presented.</td>', 'Ah! Should have used "Broke" instead of "Broken". Excellent take on the challenge. I think this fits within the spirit of the challenge theme.  Technically without flaws and tastefully presented.', '2004-12-13 01:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059069, 127979, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like where you were going with this. I think if you showed more of the picture, your entry would have more impact. Where is he sleeping? What''s he wearing? What''s his story? etc. Lighting is a bit harsh but otherwise a technically sound presentation.</td>', 'I like where you were going with this. I think if you showed more of the picture, your entry would have more impact. Where is he sleeping? What''s he wearing? What''s his story? etc. Lighting is a bit harsh but otherwise a technically sound presentation.', '2004-12-13 01:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059070, 127890, 22479, '<td valign="top">Yay! Woody bashing! Let the games begin!<br/> <br/>Technically without faults. Excellent exposure, focus, and detail. Interesting ''cot''. I think this fits within the spirit of the challenge theme. Well done.</td>', 'Yay! Woody bashing! Let the games begin! Technically without faults. Excellent exposure, focus, and detail. Interesting ''cot''. I think this fits within the spirit of the challenge theme. Well done.', '2004-12-13 01:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059073, 127594, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice low key entry, fits well artistically. Fits well with the spirit of the challenge theme.</td>', 'Nice low key entry, fits well artistically. Fits well with the spirit of the challenge theme.', '2004-12-13 01:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059074, 127332, 22479, '<td valign="top">This brought a chuckle or two out of me. :) <br/> <br/>Great take on the challenge theme. I hope this does well.</td>', 'This brought a chuckle or two out of me. :)  Great take on the challenge theme. I hope this does well.', '2004-12-13 01:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059080, 127346, 22479, '<td valign="top">Hmm...This would be an impressive feat without the aid of photoshop. I can see you printed your head but I cannot figure out what you did to your neck on up. Cloned out? In any event, this is one my top picks! Well done.</td>', 'Hmm...This would be an impressive feat without the aid of photoshop. I can see you printed your head but I cannot figure out what you did to your neck on up. Cloned out? In any event, this is one my top picks! Well done.', '2004-12-13 02:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059082, 126979, 22479, '<td valign="top">Moody, gritty, and moving. Artistically, message conveyed well. Good use of duotone. I like the raw, unprocessed look. Good entry that is within the spirit of the challenge theme.</td>', 'Moody, gritty, and moving. Artistically, message conveyed well. Good use of duotone. I like the raw, unprocessed look. Good entry that is within the spirit of the challenge theme.', '2004-12-13 02:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059084, 127984, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of color. Technically adequate in all aspects. Very nice artistic presentation overall, and appropriate for challenge theme.</td>', 'Excellent use of color. Technically adequate in all aspects. Very nice artistic presentation overall, and appropriate for challenge theme.', '2004-12-13 02:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059087, 127790, 22479, '<td valign="top">Technical details: excellent tonal range, focus, sharpness, and DOF. I like the low key appearance which adds to the mood of the photograph. Very tasteful and artistic presentation overall.</td>', 'Technical details: excellent tonal range, focus, sharpness, and DOF. I like the low key appearance which adds to the mood of the photograph. Very tasteful and artistic presentation overall.', '2004-12-13 02:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059092, 128002, 22479, '<td valign="top">Hi there. I''d like to spend some time and give you a detailed critique.<br/> <br/>Challenge theme: Appropriate. Fits within the spirit of the challenge.<br/> <br/>Technical details:<br/>- Size: Inadequate. Please resize to 600-640 pixels in all future submissions.<br/>- Focus: Appears to be satisfactory. Fine detail is present.<br/>- Tonal range: Compressed. No tonal values in either extreme.<br/>- Exposure: Adequate for given artistic presentation.<br/> <br/>Artistic details: Your composition and framing works well here. The gritty duotone sets the mood. There''s not enough pixels here to really give your photo the impact it deserves and can potentially impart. <br/> <br/>Overall: This is a good effort which is unfortunately hampered by technical limitations imposed by the size of the entry.<br/></td>', 'Hi there. I''d like to spend some time and give you a detailed critique. Challenge theme: Appropriate. Fits within the spirit of the challenge. Technical details:- Size: Inadequate. Please resize to 600-640 pixels in all future submissions.- Focus: Appears to be satisfactory. Fine detail is present.- Tonal range: Compressed. No tonal values in either extreme.- Exposure: Adequate for given artistic presentation. Artistic details: Your composition and framing works well here. The gritty duotone sets the mood. There''s not enough pixels here to really give your photo the impact it deserves and can potentially impart.  Overall: This is a good effort which is unfortunately hampered by technical limitations imposed by the size of the entry.', '2004-12-13 02:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059094, 127082, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. I like the perspective and framing. The model is showing the appropriate emotions to make this one work. Technically aspects beyond reproach. Well done.</td>', 'Excellent composition. I like the perspective and framing. The model is showing the appropriate emotions to make this one work. Technically aspects beyond reproach. Well done.', '2004-12-13 02:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059097, 127647, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think this one works best of all the broken homes entries. The perspective and composition is excellent, as is the lighting. Technically without any significant flaws.</td>', 'I think this one works best of all the broken homes entries. The perspective and composition is excellent, as is the lighting. Technically without any significant flaws.', '2004-12-13 02:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059099, 127352, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think this one works well, one of the better broken bulb entries. Good use of long shutter. Nicely exposed. The motion blur adds a lot of interest to this shot.</td>', 'I think this one works well, one of the better broken bulb entries. Good use of long shutter. Nicely exposed. The motion blur adds a lot of interest to this shot.', '2004-12-13 02:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059100, 127869, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. Tastefully and artistcally framed. Nice tonal range. Excellent exposure and detail. Stark duotone conveys the message and with great visual impact. Nicely done.</td>', 'Excellent composition. Tastefully and artistcally framed. Nice tonal range. Excellent exposure and detail. Stark duotone conveys the message and with great visual impact. Nicely done.', '2004-12-13 02:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1059103, 127979, 25500, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I''m not getting the feeling of broken spirit.  Sure sleeping on concrete is bad, but the blanket looks clean as does the subject, so it doesn''t have the look of someone exposed to life''s slings and arrows.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I''m not getting the feeling of broken spirit.  Sure sleeping on concrete is bad, but the blanket looks clean as does the subject, so it doesn''t have the look of someone exposed to life''s slings and arrows.', '2004-12-13 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
