(1060006, 126761, 24925, '<td valign="top">Jane Smith?  This is a somewhat bland looking image and is missing the human element of pain...I know the hands are there, but I''m not at all convinced.  And the "Jane Smith" seems very ''made up''...</td>', 'Jane Smith?  This is a somewhat bland looking image and is missing the human element of pain...I know the hands are there, but I''m not at all convinced.  And the "Jane Smith" seems very ''made up''...', '2004-12-13 12:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060016, 127082, 24925, '<td valign="top">Well done, although seems too sterilized for a broken heart.  Where''s the runny nose, the blotchy make-up, the million emotions?  I''ll give it a 7 because it''s a great photo but I''m not convinced...</td>', 'Well done, although seems too sterilized for a broken heart.  Where''s the runny nose, the blotchy make-up, the million emotions?  I''ll give it a 7 because it''s a great photo but I''m not convinced...', '2004-12-13 12:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
