(1060056, 127862, 22734, '<td valign="top">A solar explosion. A glass explosion and color explosion combined here to explode the viewers mind. Great technique. 8<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-20 00:14:35.</i></td>', 'A solar explosion. A glass explosion and color explosion combined here to explode the viewers mind. Great technique. 8', '2004-12-13 12:49:46.000000', '2004-12-20 00:14:35.000000', 1),
(1060057, 127082, 15497, '<td valign="top">This is top5 for me. Excellent executed. I hope you ribbon.</td>', 'This is top5 for me. Excellent executed. I hope you ribbon.', '2004-12-13 12:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060060, 127432, 24925, '<td valign="top">When a photo lacks any emotion (such as the ''setup'' lightbulb shots normally do) you need something else.  This ''something else'' is usually a ''Wow factor'' or something exciting/interesting about the photo to draw you in.  I''m not getting any of that from this photo.  What were you ''going for''?  How could you have achieved the "Wow" that was needed?</td>', 'When a photo lacks any emotion (such as the ''setup'' lightbulb shots normally do) you need something else.  This ''something else'' is usually a ''Wow factor'' or something exciting/interesting about the photo to draw you in.  I''m not getting any of that from this photo.  What were you ''going for''?  How could you have achieved the "Wow" that was needed?', '2004-12-13 12:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
