(1060577, 127604, 28003, '<td valign="top">Nice! Perhaps a touch more DOF to make the cookies at the back slightly sharper, and also remove (or at least straighten) the visible seam at the back.</td>', 'Nice! Perhaps a touch more DOF to make the cookies at the back slightly sharper, and also remove (or at least straighten) the visible seam at the back.', '2004-12-13 17:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060579, 127662, 28003, '<td valign="top">It''s not the most inventive shot... you took a picture of an object directly head on, with fairly flat/uninteresting lighting. Perhaps try experimenting with more interesting angles and lighting.</td>', 'It''s not the most inventive shot... you took a picture of an object directly head on, with fairly flat/uninteresting lighting. Perhaps try experimenting with more interesting angles and lighting.', '2004-12-13 17:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060582, 127352, 28003, '<td valign="top">I really like the choice of background color - and the lighting is great. I''m not too enthusiastic about the blur above the bulb though - I guess it''s meant to convey motion, but it just doesn''t work for me, and seems out of place.</td>', 'I really like the choice of background color - and the lighting is great. I''m not too enthusiastic about the blur above the bulb though - I guess it''s meant to convey motion, but it just doesn''t work for me, and seems out of place.', '2004-12-13 17:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060594, 127599, 28003, '<td valign="top">A good idea. I''d suggest perhaps a little less DOF to blur the asphalt more.</td>', 'A good idea. I''d suggest perhaps a little less DOF to blur the asphalt more.', '2004-12-13 17:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060610, 127852, 16148, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection of the doll but might have cropped more off the edges.</td>', 'I like the reflection of the doll but might have cropped more off the edges.', '2004-12-13 17:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060621, 127346, 16148, '<td valign="top">This is some wild stuff!  I can''t figure out how you did this.  I like the extra negative space on top emphasizing the missing head.  Congratulations on an original idea.</td>', 'This is some wild stuff!  I can''t figure out how you did this.  I like the extra negative space on top emphasizing the missing head.  Congratulations on an original idea.', '2004-12-13 18:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060651, 127619, 25464, '<td valign="top">The composition and DOF are fine, but this one doesn''t hold any real appeal for me.  It also doesn''t appear broken, simply open.</td>', 'The composition and DOF are fine, but this one doesn''t hold any real appeal for me.  It also doesn''t appear broken, simply open.', '2004-12-13 18:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060666, 127923, 23312, '<td valign="top">Nice "broken" image - I feel, though, that I would like to see more texture of the snow - or something else to put it more in a context (besides the title).</td>', 'Nice "broken" image - I feel, though, that I would like to see more texture of the snow - or something else to put it more in a context (besides the title).', '2004-12-13 18:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060679, 127974, 9906, '<td valign="top">Definately broken, but not all that interesting...<br/>TC</td>', 'Definately broken, but not all that interesting...TC', '2004-12-13 19:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060680, 127841, 9906, '<td valign="top">A little busy.  The kids kinda take your eye away form the (assumed) subject of the shot, the pinata.  White balance also appears to be off a little.  YOur people are kinda orange.<br/>TC</td>', 'A little busy.  The kids kinda take your eye away form the (assumed) subject of the shot, the pinata.  White balance also appears to be off a little.  YOur people are kinda orange.TC', '2004-12-13 19:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060684, 127597, 9906, '<td valign="top">I never have and never will truly appreciate shots that are treated with this type of psychedelic coloring...<br/>TC</td>', 'I never have and never will truly appreciate shots that are treated with this type of psychedelic coloring...TC', '2004-12-13 19:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060685, 127648, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and almost abstract.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely lit and almost abstract.TC', '2004-12-13 19:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060687, 126712, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that partially formed is the same as ''broken''... <br/>TC</td>', 'I''m not sure that partially formed is the same as ''broken''... TC', '2004-12-13 19:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060688, 127948, 28003, '<td valign="top">It''s rather cluttered, with little sense of composition, apart from the two circles. I realise that''s probably what you were going for, but it doesn''t do much for me, I''m afraid - sorry!</td>', 'It''s rather cluttered, with little sense of composition, apart from the two circles. I realise that''s probably what you were going for, but it doesn''t do much for me, I''m afraid - sorry!', '2004-12-13 19:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060689, 127973, 28003, '<td valign="top">Nice tones.</td>', 'Nice tones.', '2004-12-13 19:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060690, 127806, 28003, '<td valign="top">A brave abstract attempt... not sure about the blurriness.</td>', 'A brave abstract attempt... not sure about the blurriness.', '2004-12-13 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060692, 127760, 28003, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea... nice colors, although the lighting on the balloons is a little harsh.</td>', 'Interesting idea... nice colors, although the lighting on the balloons is a little harsh.', '2004-12-13 19:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060694, 127332, 28003, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, technically proficient shot, but it does seem a little bit like a cute snapshot that relies too heavily on the title to fit the challenge.<br/></td>', 'Nice lighting, technically proficient shot, but it does seem a little bit like a cute snapshot that relies too heavily on the title to fit the challenge.', '2004-12-13 19:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060695, 127870, 28003, '<td valign="top">Nice, technically proficient shot, good contrasting colors. I''m not sure I get the purpose of the rose though.<br/></td>', 'Nice, technically proficient shot, good contrasting colors. I''m not sure I get the purpose of the rose though.', '2004-12-13 19:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060698, 126748, 28003, '<td valign="top">Could do with being a little sharper, and possibly some curve editing to bring up darker areas.</td>', 'Could do with being a little sharper, and possibly some curve editing to bring up darker areas.', '2004-12-13 19:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060702, 127971, 28003, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - I like the way the eye is drawn along the fence, but I''m then distracted by the person sitting on the bench. I wish the fence occupied more of the frame - maybe cropped more at the top, or shot from a lower angle... I''m not sure. Good job though!<br/></td>', 'Nice composition - I like the way the eye is drawn along the fence, but I''m then distracted by the person sitting on the bench. I wish the fence occupied more of the frame - maybe cropped more at the top, or shot from a lower angle... I''m not sure. Good job though!', '2004-12-13 19:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060703, 128005, 28003, '<td valign="top">Nice tonality and textures.</td>', 'Nice tonality and textures.', '2004-12-13 19:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060704, 127047, 28003, '<td valign="top">Interesting, creative take on the challenge. A bit cluttered - perhaps clearing away some of the smaller fragments might make for a cleaner shot, but no biggie.</td>', 'Interesting, creative take on the challenge. A bit cluttered - perhaps clearing away some of the smaller fragments might make for a cleaner shot, but no biggie.', '2004-12-13 19:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060715, 127873, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, I  am a boataholic.  I like the rust, the texture and the tilted POV.  The colours are also nice and the blue sky gives the feeling of cold and emptyness.  The only thing I can pick on is that I find the shot a bit to tight, probably shot with a tele lens.</td>', 'I like the subject, I  am a boataholic.  I like the rust, the texture and the tilted POV.  The colours are also nice and the blue sky gives the feeling of cold and emptyness.  The only thing I can pick on is that I find the shot a bit to tight, probably shot with a tele lens.', '2004-12-13 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060719, 127806, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition but I find it distracting to have such soft focus.</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition but I find it distracting to have such soft focus.', '2004-12-13 19:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060721, 126448, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very creative thinking and a brilliant execution.</td>', 'Very creative thinking and a brilliant execution.', '2004-12-13 19:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060722, 127980, 7560, '<td valign="top">A 1 for offensive subject matter. ;) Kidding. 6 for a cute idea. And let me just point out, you now have 24 to go before you can even touch the Yankees. <br/> <br/>Lets Go Yankees!</td>', 'A 1 for offensive subject matter. ;) Kidding. 6 for a cute idea. And let me just point out, you now have 24 to go before you can even touch the Yankees.  Lets Go Yankees!', '2004-12-13 19:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060732, 128005, 29486, '<td valign="top">Too close to backdrop. Making the image vertical probably would have been better too.</td>', 'Too close to backdrop. Making the image vertical probably would have been better too.', '2004-12-13 19:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1060752, 127346, 18403, '<td valign="top">Ten.</td>', 'Ten.', '2004-12-13 20:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
