(1060789, 127890, 29477, '<td valign="top">Finally a positive use of the woody...very creative.  My highest rated woody shot in my short existence here...7</td>', 'Finally a positive use of the woody...very creative.  My highest rated woody shot in my short existence here...7', '2004-12-13 20:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
