(1060905, 127082, 27375, '<td valign="top">man. i just love this. i keep comeing back to it. i dont know if this is fake or what but  the tears seem very real by the expression on her face. well done and a very good example of broken.</td>', 'man. i just love this. i keep comeing back to it. i dont know if this is fake or what but  the tears seem very real by the expression on her face. well done and a very good example of broken.', '2004-12-13 21:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
