(1061017, 127927, 25397, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I think others will complain about the sharpness about this picture but really I like it. See, this reminds me of my old grama''s house where everything was set up perfect and clean. The sharpness seems to make everything in place, sort of like a story-book kind of feeling... I like this.</td>', 'Hmm, I think others will complain about the sharpness about this picture but really I like it. See, this reminds me of my old grama''s house where everything was set up perfect and clean. The sharpness seems to make everything in place, sort of like a story-book kind of feeling... I like this.', '2004-12-13 23:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1061029, 127948, 29269, '<td valign="top">You didn''t need to take rebel apart to get yourself a ribbon...<br/> <br/>Composition: Something is bothering me about it, probably a lack of focal point. The circles (from the EF mount?) could have been used to accentuate a recognizeable object in this mess, for example, the ''digital rebel'' logo on the front of the case. Just a suggestion. <br/>Challenge: The image meets and exceeds the assigned topic.<br/>Overall, 8.</td>', 'You didn''t need to take rebel apart to get yourself a ribbon... Composition: Something is bothering me about it, probably a lack of focal point. The circles (from the EF mount?) could have been used to accentuate a recognizeable object in this mess, for example, the ''digital rebel'' logo on the front of the case. Just a suggestion. Challenge: The image meets and exceeds the assigned topic.Overall, 8.', '2004-12-13 23:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
