(1061800, 128002, 29535, '<td valign="top">Far too small, small images do not do well in challenges.  Please use the full 640x640 we are allowed.  Aside from that, nice tone,focus and good composition.  Just a shame it''s so damn small.</td>', 'Far too small, small images do not do well in challenges.  Please use the full 640x640 we are allowed.  Aside from that, nice tone,focus and good composition.  Just a shame it''s so damn small.', '2004-12-14 12:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
