(1062010, 126448, 15207, '<td valign="top">That is absolutely hilarious. Really nice B&amp;W. Only suggestion would be to have a bit darker shadows for added contrast. But excellent overall. Really really like this one. It stands out and it''s unique. Good luck.</td>', 'That is absolutely hilarious. Really nice B&W. Only suggestion would be to have a bit darker shadows for added contrast. But excellent overall. Really really like this one. It stands out and it''s unique. Good luck.', '2004-12-14 14:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
