(1062052, 127994, 27524, '<td valign="top">Cute idea :) nice done.</td>', 'Cute idea :) nice done.', '2004-12-14 15:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062063, 127600, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is great!  I haven''t had anything this sad happen yet, but I''ll be sure to think of this when it does!  :)  BOL</td>', 'This is great!  I haven''t had anything this sad happen yet, but I''ll be sure to think of this when it does!  :)  BOL', '2004-12-14 15:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062092, 127082, 14509, '<td valign="top">I like the dark tones of this image as it suits the Brokenhearted feeling. The tear drop accentuates the mood. Very well done, Manny.</td>', 'I like the dark tones of this image as it suits the Brokenhearted feeling. The tear drop accentuates the mood. Very well done, Manny.', '2004-12-14 15:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062094, 127984, 19608, '<td valign="top">Super job on the lighting - and nice colors as well.  The yellow highlights are very suppostive.</td>', 'Super job on the lighting - and nice colors as well.  The yellow highlights are very suppostive.', '2004-12-14 15:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062099, 127888, 30303, '<td valign="top">I love this one...totally feels like someone just sat on it and it collapsed...I love the angle of the shot, and I love how it does not have a boring white background!  Very nice texture, the cracks on the ground fit the theme nicely.</td>', 'I love this one...totally feels like someone just sat on it and it collapsed...I love the angle of the shot, and I love how it does not have a boring white background!  Very nice texture, the cracks on the ground fit the theme nicely.', '2004-12-14 16:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062100, 127664, 19608, '<td valign="top">This DOUBLE BROKEN is wondeful.  The old building is itself is a superb entry - very well composed and exposed.  The focus is sharp througout.  Then ADD the broken-spirited man to the scene and you have a true unique winner.  Look out for the ribbon train - it should be headed in your direction.</td>', 'This DOUBLE BROKEN is wondeful.  The old building is itself is a superb entry - very well composed and exposed.  The focus is sharp througout.  Then ADD the broken-spirited man to the scene and you have a true unique winner.  Look out for the ribbon train - it should be headed in your direction.', '2004-12-14 16:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062101, 127832, 30303, '<td valign="top">Missed the theme in my opinion.</td>', 'Missed the theme in my opinion.', '2004-12-14 16:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062103, 127347, 30303, '<td valign="top">This one made me smile :D<br/> <br/>I only wish the edges of the opener, especially in the top right hand corner, didn''t have that weird tinge along it...</td>', 'This one made me smile :D I only wish the edges of the opener, especially in the top right hand corner, didn''t have that weird tinge along it...', '2004-12-14 16:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062104, 127767, 30303, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, lacking in composition, though.</td>', 'Interesting shot, lacking in composition, though.', '2004-12-14 16:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062105, 128002, 19608, '<td valign="top">NIcely shot - the echo of the shadow shape gives it some graphic appeal.  I know a bunch of folks have told you to use more of the allowed file size.</td>', 'NIcely shot - the echo of the shadow shape gives it some graphic appeal.  I know a bunch of folks have told you to use more of the allowed file size.', '2004-12-14 16:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062106, 127597, 30303, '<td valign="top">Inverted colors aren''t doing it for me...</td>', 'Inverted colors aren''t doing it for me...', '2004-12-14 16:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062108, 127994, 30303, '<td valign="top">VERY nice shot, must have been so hard to get!  I love this :)</td>', 'VERY nice shot, must have been so hard to get!  I love this :)', '2004-12-14 16:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062111, 127890, 19608, '<td valign="top">The only thing wrong with this photo is the title - but that won''t cost any points from me.  Perfectly setup, great lighting, and funny as can be.  The addition of the tiny band-aide on the "good" leg is an added bonus.  Humor doesn''t normally score as high as it should on DPC, but I really hope yours proves to be the exception.  It SHOULD be in ribbon country.</td>', 'The only thing wrong with this photo is the title - but that won''t cost any points from me.  Perfectly setup, great lighting, and funny as can be.  The addition of the tiny band-aide on the "good" leg is an added bonus.  Humor doesn''t normally score as high as it should on DPC, but I really hope yours proves to be the exception.  It SHOULD be in ribbon country.', '2004-12-14 16:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062113, 127997, 30303, '<td valign="top">Don''t really like the perspective on this one very much...</td>', 'Don''t really like the perspective on this one very much...', '2004-12-14 16:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062114, 127760, 30303, '<td valign="top">Too much empty space...I think if you cropped a little from the top and bottom...</td>', 'Too much empty space...I think if you cropped a little from the top and bottom...', '2004-12-14 16:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062116, 127900, 30303, '<td valign="top">Sad image...war stinks.</td>', 'Sad image...war stinks.', '2004-12-14 16:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062118, 127625, 30303, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the title I''d have no idea what the point was...</td>', 'If it weren''t for the title I''d have no idea what the point was...', '2004-12-14 16:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062119, 127432, 30303, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, very cool shot.</td>', 'I like the composition, very cool shot.', '2004-12-14 16:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062120, 127554, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your placement is perfect as is the rim lighting.  Truly a piece of art.  The white border holds it together very well.   It has a lot of negative space - not really sure if that helps it or not.   It SHOUTS broken extremely well.</td>', 'Your placement is perfect as is the rim lighting.  Truly a piece of art.  The white border holds it together very well.   It has a lot of negative space - not really sure if that helps it or not.   It SHOUTS broken extremely well.', '2004-12-14 16:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062121, 126721, 30303, '<td valign="top">Don''t think I like the color choice....green clashes with brown...</td>', 'Don''t think I like the color choice....green clashes with brown...', '2004-12-14 16:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062125, 126334, 30303, '<td valign="top">The blood vastly increases the level of interest for me :D  The only thinig I don''t think I like is the top of the shot fading darkly like that...</td>', 'The blood vastly increases the level of interest for me :D  The only thinig I don''t think I like is the top of the shot fading darkly like that...', '2004-12-14 16:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062127, 127347, 29535, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, great shot.</td>', 'Nice idea, great shot.', '2004-12-14 16:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062131, 127852, 30303, '<td valign="top">...if she was closer to the lower right hand corner....otherwise, cool shot.</td>', '...if she was closer to the lower right hand corner....otherwise, cool shot.', '2004-12-14 16:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062140, 127813, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great use of the glass to get an interesting frame around the carwrecks-scene.<br/>I like the choice for B&amp;W and think that the tones are excellent. I also like the shadowy darker foreground vs the brighter view trough the glass frame.</td>', 'Great use of the glass to get an interesting frame around the carwrecks-scene.I like the choice for B&W and think that the tones are excellent. I also like the shadowy darker foreground vs the brighter view trough the glass frame.', '2004-12-14 16:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062144, 127816, 3032, '<td valign="top">Such a simple subject but such a strong portayal. I love it how the dark broken tree is so dark vs the bright sky (with tone preserved instead of blown out = good). The frame you made also works well with that. Good use of background elements to give the viewer a feeling about what he is looking at and in what settings.</td>', 'Such a simple subject but such a strong portayal. I love it how the dark broken tree is so dark vs the bright sky (with tone preserved instead of blown out = good). The frame you made also works well with that. Good use of background elements to give the viewer a feeling about what he is looking at and in what settings.', '2004-12-14 16:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062146, 127655, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice dark mood with interesting shadows and lines.</td>', 'Nice dark mood with interesting shadows and lines.', '2004-12-14 16:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062149, 126448, 3032, '<td valign="top">Hilarious. Because of the thin shell even the inside that we cannot see shines through and even there the creature marked the wall, splendid!<br/></td>', 'Hilarious. Because of the thin shell even the inside that we cannot see shines through and even there the creature marked the wall, splendid!', '2004-12-14 16:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062154, 127900, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good subject and so very well done. <br/></td>', 'Good subject and so very well done. ', '2004-12-14 16:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062161, 127347, 27293, '<td valign="top">Make sure the wine key is in almost all the way (looks like it is), and don''t tilt it when pulling up, pull straight up, preferrably without jerking, but with a smooth, but steady movement. If this does happen, no big deal, unless you need to serve the bottle. Otherwise just push the remainder of the cork inside the bottle and filter whine through cheese cloth. [can you tell i used to bartend until recently?] =)</td>', 'Make sure the wine key is in almost all the way (looks like it is), and don''t tilt it when pulling up, pull straight up, preferrably without jerking, but with a smooth, but steady movement. If this does happen, no big deal, unless you need to serve the bottle. Otherwise just push the remainder of the cork inside the bottle and filter whine through cheese cloth. [can you tell i used to bartend until recently?] =)', '2004-12-14 16:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062163, 127601, 27293, '<td valign="top">I like the colors. Better than on other broken light bulb shots.</td>', 'I like the colors. Better than on other broken light bulb shots.', '2004-12-14 16:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062165, 128009, 27293, '<td valign="top">Uhm, i guess not everything looks nice close up.</td>', 'Uhm, i guess not everything looks nice close up.', '2004-12-14 16:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062166, 127647, 3032, '<td valign="top">The light, the shadows, the lines, the dof it all comes together so well. The house seems to tell a story, the way this is photoghaphed makes me look at it for a relatively long time. I like it a lot, it is my favorite in this challenge.<br/> <br/>The lines of the broken wall intersect and flow over in the lines of the shadow inside. As if the house knows its fate. Perhaps that explains a bit what I see.</td>', 'The light, the shadows, the lines, the dof it all comes together so well. The house seems to tell a story, the way this is photoghaphed makes me look at it for a relatively long time. I like it a lot, it is my favorite in this challenge. The lines of the broken wall intersect and flow over in the lines of the shadow inside. As if the house knows its fate. Perhaps that explains a bit what I see.', '2004-12-14 16:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062168, 127649, 28188, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  There is a feeling of surrealism to it and reading the word "broken" from the bottom up only adds to it. I only wish there was something in the upper corners to make it more balanced.  If you don''t have any melting clocks handy, then perhaphs a goldfish to the left  and a cabbage to the right?</td>', 'I like this one.  There is a feeling of surrealism to it and reading the word "broken" from the bottom up only adds to it. I only wish there was something in the upper corners to make it more balanced.  If you don''t have any melting clocks handy, then perhaphs a goldfish to the left  and a cabbage to the right?', '2004-12-14 16:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062169, 127630, 27293, '<td valign="top">VEry good quality technically, not very interesting otherwise.</td>', 'VEry good quality technically, not very interesting otherwise.', '2004-12-14 16:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062171, 127871, 27293, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I''d make it slightly more contrasty.</td>', 'Very cool. I''d make it slightly more contrasty.', '2004-12-14 16:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062173, 127065, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good title.<br/>I like the idea and how the lower part of the photo looks (it looks like a 10 score).  But than the background above the neck spoils it. The ugly wall and roof, the unrelated matter and especially the blown out (exposure-wise) windows draw so much attention a way. Just where you''d like to focus all of your attention on the cut off face. Averages out to a 7.<br/> <br/>I''d like more of the background the way the floor looks. The highlights on the body are no problem for me.</td>', 'Good title.I like the idea and how the lower part of the photo looks (it looks like a 10 score).  But than the background above the neck spoils it. The ugly wall and roof, the unrelated matter and especially the blown out (exposure-wise) windows draw so much attention a way. Just where you''d like to focus all of your attention on the cut off face. Averages out to a 7. I''d like more of the background the way the floor looks. The highlights on the body are no problem for me.', '2004-12-14 16:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062175, 127346, 27293, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2004-12-14 16:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062178, 127600, 27293, '<td valign="top">Very cool, i would make the background a different color. It dominates here, and it should instead highlight the green of the plant. Thanks for a cool idea of what to do with old lens =)</td>', 'Very cool, i would make the background a different color. It dominates here, and it should instead highlight the green of the plant. Thanks for a cool idea of what to do with old lens =)', '2004-12-14 16:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062179, 127346, 28188, '<td valign="top">Good idea, well executed.</td>', 'Good idea, well executed.', '2004-12-14 16:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062180, 127655, 11769, '<td valign="top">I have been thinking of this photograph all day.  Strange how some images stick. I think it was because I have a hard time knowing what the picture is about. Looks like light from a window striking snow and yard with some sort of brickwork. It also is the abstract quality and composition that is so well executed that demands I take a moment and think. I like this very much.</td>', 'I have been thinking of this photograph all day.  Strange how some images stick. I think it was because I have a hard time knowing what the picture is about. Looks like light from a window striking snow and yard with some sort of brickwork. It also is the abstract quality and composition that is so well executed that demands I take a moment and think. I like this very much.', '2004-12-14 17:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062184, 127858, 28188, '<td valign="top">I like it.  The black and whithe high contrast makes it look broken and creepy.</td>', 'I like it.  The black and whithe high contrast makes it look broken and creepy.', '2004-12-14 17:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062185, 127927, 20779, '<td valign="top">I just can''t get enough of this image - almost doesn''t appear to be real. The lighting, perspective and composition within the frame are just genius.</td>', 'I just can''t get enough of this image - almost doesn''t appear to be real. The lighting, perspective and composition within the frame are just genius.', '2004-12-14 17:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062188, 127664, 20779, '<td valign="top">This photo has so much impact and force within it. It is this kind of work that makes me love photography. I would love to see this ribbon, but fear that it isn''t "glossy" enough. Please take that as my personal opinion and compliment.</td>', 'This photo has so much impact and force within it. It is this kind of work that makes me love photography. I would love to see this ribbon, but fear that it isn''t "glossy" enough. Please take that as my personal opinion and compliment.', '2004-12-14 17:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
