(1062845, 127811, 28003, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2004-12-14 23:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062851, 127804, 28003, '<td valign="top">Very nice... I like that you didn''t center the shot on the fracture, so the there''s a natural progression outward to the upper left.</td>', 'Very nice... I like that you didn''t center the shot on the fracture, so the there''s a natural progression outward to the upper left.', '2004-12-14 23:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062855, 126724, 28003, '<td valign="top">Kind of average... the foreground is underexposed, the background is overexposed. I like the way the eye is drawn to the door, however.</td>', 'Kind of average... the foreground is underexposed, the background is overexposed. I like the way the eye is drawn to the door, however.', '2004-12-14 23:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062857, 127885, 28003, '<td valign="top">This has to be the most tenuous connection to the challenge yet.</td>', 'This has to be the most tenuous connection to the challenge yet.', '2004-12-14 23:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1062860, 127346, 28003, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very inventive. I''m sure I''m not the only one who is curious as to how you did it. I''m also sure it''ll do very well.</td>', 'Wow. Very inventive. I''m sure I''m not the only one who is curious as to how you did it. I''m also sure it''ll do very well.', '2004-12-15 00:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063001, 127890, 29168, '<td valign="top">OMG! Is he gonna be O.K? What would we do without our infamous Woody photos?! :''( Very nice studio composition and good lighting - as usual.</td>', 'OMG! Is he gonna be O.K? What would we do without our infamous Woody photos?! :''( Very nice studio composition and good lighting - as usual.', '2004-12-15 00:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063027, 126699, 22537, '<td valign="top">The dark and light tones are perfect.  Very sharp image and  great composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'The dark and light tones are perfect.  Very sharp image and  great composition.  Good luck.', '2004-12-15 00:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063031, 127903, 29168, '<td valign="top">Love the colours, pity the focus is so soft. Good compostion. 6.</td>', 'Love the colours, pity the focus is so soft. Good compostion. 6.', '2004-12-15 00:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063033, 127871, 22537, '<td valign="top">Very creative and excellent way of presenting broken glass. Good luck.</td>', 'Very creative and excellent way of presenting broken glass. Good luck.', '2004-12-15 00:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063042, 127816, 22537, '<td valign="top">Great picture. The subject does not dominate the shot and is well placed within the whole image.  Good luck</td>', 'Great picture. The subject does not dominate the shot and is well placed within the whole image.  Good luck', '2004-12-15 00:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063046, 127971, 22537, '<td valign="top">The subtle tones and the meandering fence are a great combination. Beautiful image.  Good luck.</td>', 'The subtle tones and the meandering fence are a great combination. Beautiful image.  Good luck.', '2004-12-15 00:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063052, 127627, 22537, '<td valign="top">So simple but effective. Well balanced and definitely meets the challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'So simple but effective. Well balanced and definitely meets the challenge.  Good luck.', '2004-12-15 00:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063086, 127813, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing photo. I am impressed with the message, the creative eye, as well as the technique. Nice job.</td>', 'This is an amazing photo. I am impressed with the message, the creative eye, as well as the technique. Nice job.', '2004-12-15 00:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063098, 127806, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is the perfect photo for this challenge. I like the focus on your subject and not on the cracks or threads. The title is perfect. Stunning and overwhelming. Very nice!</td>', 'This is the perfect photo for this challenge. I like the focus on your subject and not on the cracks or threads. The title is perfect. Stunning and overwhelming. Very nice!', '2004-12-15 00:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063101, 127084, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the earthy greens and greys.</td>', 'I like the concept and the earthy greens and greys.', '2004-12-15 00:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063105, 127790, 22384, '<td valign="top">I really like the value range - low key in this case to give a melancholy or forelorn feeling. Nice job.</td>', 'I really like the value range - low key in this case to give a melancholy or forelorn feeling. Nice job.', '2004-12-15 00:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063110, 127610, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites of the challenge. The nostalgic feeling, the facing of the windmill to the left, looking back to the past: a thing forgotten and left behind. Nice job.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites of the challenge. The nostalgic feeling, the facing of the windmill to the left, looking back to the past: a thing forgotten and left behind. Nice job.', '2004-12-15 00:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063133, 127981, 22384, '<td valign="top">I just like this. I swear the candle light is flickering. I am a big Halloween (the original movie) fan and this is reminiscent of the opening credits; I can almost hear the eerie music. Very appealing to me for my own personal biases. If people can give 1''s based on emotions and personal preferences, I can give a 10 for the same reason.</td>', 'I just like this. I swear the candle light is flickering. I am a big Halloween (the original movie) fan and this is reminiscent of the opening credits; I can almost hear the eerie music. Very appealing to me for my own personal biases. If people can give 1''s based on emotions and personal preferences, I can give a 10 for the same reason.', '2004-12-15 00:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063137, 127923, 22384, '<td valign="top">Simple, stark, and elegant. I love it. 10</td>', 'Simple, stark, and elegant. I love it. 10', '2004-12-15 00:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063148, 128011, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like this. Hectic, chaotic, and intense. Fits the challenge well. It also evokes the dark side of the holidays that we try to sweep under the rug. Daring and deserving. Bravo</td>', 'I like this. Hectic, chaotic, and intense. Fits the challenge well. It also evokes the dark side of the holidays that we try to sweep under the rug. Daring and deserving. Bravo', '2004-12-15 01:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063151, 127888, 22384, '<td valign="top">This image is so disorienting. It is difficult to look at, and therefore it succeeds for me.  9</td>', 'This image is so disorienting. It is difficult to look at, and therefore it succeeds for me.  9', '2004-12-15 01:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063160, 127484, 22384, '<td valign="top">Brutal and stark. It certainly fits the challenge. I love the choice of high key. I am uncomfortable with the cropping. Too much ditch, not enough car. 7</td>', 'Brutal and stark. It certainly fits the challenge. I love the choice of high key. I am uncomfortable with the cropping. Too much ditch, not enough car. 7', '2004-12-15 01:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063165, 127816, 22384, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant, and the background is stunning. This image is very appealing to me. Classic and moody. 9</td>', 'Simple, elegant, and the background is stunning. This image is very appealing to me. Classic and moody. 9', '2004-12-15 01:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063168, 127570, 22384, '<td valign="top">Briliant destaurization. So well composed and fitting for the challenge. Very nice. 9</td>', 'Briliant destaurization. So well composed and fitting for the challenge. Very nice. 9', '2004-12-15 01:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063173, 127906, 22384, '<td valign="top">Creative and daring. Hope in the ruins.</td>', 'Creative and daring. Hope in the ruins.', '2004-12-15 01:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063178, 127852, 22384, '<td valign="top">Eerie and disturbing. I guess not so much more disturbing than Malibu Barbie. This works well for me. 8</td>', 'Eerie and disturbing. I guess not so much more disturbing than Malibu Barbie. This works well for me. 8', '2004-12-15 01:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063180, 127855, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice unique take on the mundane. It adds just that twist that makes it work.  8</td>', 'Nice unique take on the mundane. It adds just that twist that makes it work.  8', '2004-12-15 01:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063193, 127601, 22384, '<td valign="top">Lots of broken lightbulbs. I think that this is technically a nice shot. The purples and yellows just don''e work for me in this case. The soften the impact of the image. I think that, given your title, that is what you were going for, but I would like something grittier and dangerous-looking for this challenge. Just a matter of taste so a 7</td>', 'Lots of broken lightbulbs. I think that this is technically a nice shot. The purples and yellows just don''e work for me in this case. The soften the impact of the image. I think that, given your title, that is what you were going for, but I would like something grittier and dangerous-looking for this challenge. Just a matter of taste so a 7', '2004-12-15 01:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063543, 127351, 30429, '<td valign="top">it is so cute :)))) and sad....</td>', 'it is so cute :)))) and sad....', '2004-12-15 05:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063569, 127893, 28686, '<td valign="top">this  is a really clever take on the challenge</td>', 'this  is a really clever take on the challenge', '2004-12-15 06:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063599, 127346, 27812, '<td valign="top">Composition: 6, Technical: 7, Appeal: 3, Challenge: 9, Overall Calculated Average Score: 6<br/>Bumping up, really still does not appeal to me ;-), however being honest with myself, I have to re evaluate my prejudice and look at it with a focussed mind. Knowing the members I''m sure they will score this well.</td>', 'Composition: 6, Technical: 7, Appeal: 3, Challenge: 9, Overall Calculated Average Score: 6Bumping up, really still does not appeal to me ;-), however being honest with myself, I have to re evaluate my prejudice and look at it with a focussed mind. Knowing the members I''m sure they will score this well.', '2004-12-15 07:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063711, 126334, 25516, '<td valign="top">very beautiful</td>', 'very beautiful', '2004-12-15 08:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063963, 127564, 30716, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the white and the strong, vivid red of the wine</td>', 'I love the contrast between the white and the strong, vivid red of the wine', '2004-12-15 11:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063987, 127981, 6999, '<td valign="top">The black background is well achieved. The set-up, framing, and lighting though need work. There is a kind of bronze quality to the finished shot that I quite like, but overall it''s indistinct. The light: well, galss is difficult to light, and is usually more a matter of lighting a background and using the distortion of the shape of the glass to bring its presence to screen. Framing: what looks like an attempt to emply the rule of thirds is difficult when there is nothing here other than the subject - as is, it just looks off centre. The effectively employ the rule of thirds, one needs some context, some surrounding to parallel the main subject, I think. I imagine this side-lit from the left, so that the shadows fall into the negative space area to image right, and a background other than black, and I think you''d have a more dpc-friendly shot.</td>', 'The black background is well achieved. The set-up, framing, and lighting though need work. There is a kind of bronze quality to the finished shot that I quite like, but overall it''s indistinct. The light: well, galss is difficult to light, and is usually more a matter of lighting a background and using the distortion of the shape of the glass to bring its presence to screen. Framing: what looks like an attempt to emply the rule of thirds is difficult when there is nothing here other than the subject - as is, it just looks off centre. The effectively employ the rule of thirds, one needs some context, some surrounding to parallel the main subject, I think. I imagine this side-lit from the left, so that the shadows fall into the negative space area to image right, and a background other than black, and I think you''d have a more dpc-friendly shot.', '2004-12-15 11:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063990, 126699, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like this - love the stone texture you''ve achieved here. Interesting and effective composition too. I wonder if many people will see this as ''broken'' though.</td>', 'Like this - love the stone texture you''ve achieved here. Interesting and effective composition too. I wonder if many people will see this as ''broken'' though.', '2004-12-15 11:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064126, 127657, 28003, '<td valign="top">A fairly unique idea. Spoiled a little by the overexposure on the upper left.</td>', 'A fairly unique idea. Spoiled a little by the overexposure on the upper left.', '2004-12-15 12:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064129, 127857, 28003, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition... the white rectangle is a little distracting. I wonder what this would look like with some slightly less flat lighting.</td>', 'Nice simple composition... the white rectangle is a little distracting. I wonder what this would look like with some slightly less flat lighting.', '2004-12-15 12:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064133, 128001, 28003, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get the meaning. Seems somewhat like a generic eye macro that''s been squeezed into the challenge topic against its will. Technically it''s a great shot though.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get the meaning. Seems somewhat like a generic eye macro that''s been squeezed into the challenge topic against its will. Technically it''s a great shot though.', '2004-12-15 12:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064137, 127357, 28003, '<td valign="top">I think this might work better if it were taken from an angle such that the moon wasn''t nearly off the edge of the frame. Great sky texture though.</td>', 'I think this might work better if it were taken from an angle such that the moon wasn''t nearly off the edge of the frame. Great sky texture though.', '2004-12-15 13:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064139, 127597, 28003, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get the point of the negative coloring.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get the point of the negative coloring.', '2004-12-15 13:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064142, 127872, 28003, '<td valign="top">That''s extremely creepy. I''m not sure about the crop - why cut off the right leg like that?</td>', 'That''s extremely creepy. I''m not sure about the crop - why cut off the right leg like that?', '2004-12-15 13:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064214, 127600, 30573, '<td valign="top">Woa, What happend With This Lens, I could Have Used It!!!!!</td>', 'Woa, What happend With This Lens, I could Have Used It!!!!!', '2004-12-15 13:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064215, 127632, 8970, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if the entire foreground piece was in focus</td>', 'Would have been better if the entire foreground piece was in focus', '2004-12-15 13:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064220, 127811, 8970, '<td valign="top">wish more of the glass was in the background, not in the foreground</td>', 'wish more of the glass was in the background, not in the foreground', '2004-12-15 13:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064222, 126802, 8970, '<td valign="top">The yolk fully out of the shell and sliding to the right would have improved the layout</td>', 'The yolk fully out of the shell and sliding to the right would have improved the layout', '2004-12-15 13:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064223, 127929, 8970, '<td valign="top">The focus feels more on the fish than on the vase on the bottom of the tank</td>', 'The focus feels more on the fish than on the vase on the bottom of the tank', '2004-12-15 13:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064243, 127835, 30573, '<td valign="top">I really like This Shot....Makes Me Love My Home</td>', 'I really like This Shot....Makes Me Love My Home', '2004-12-15 13:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
