(1064909, 127602, 25468, '<td valign="top">Yowza! I grew up seeing things like this (dad was a tow truck driver). Really speaks out, and a great photo jounalism type shot. 7</td>', 'Yowza! I grew up seeing things like this (dad was a tow truck driver). Really speaks out, and a great photo jounalism type shot. 7', '2004-12-15 20:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
