(1064941, 126748, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>Very nice composition with a creative eye catching look. The detail is adequate and the angle so nice. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:Very nice composition with a creative eye catching look. The detail is adequate and the angle so nice. Bumping up.', '2004-12-15 21:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064944, 127984, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>A good capture with good lighting and great diagonal comp. the colors are just great and soothing. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:A good capture with good lighting and great diagonal comp. the colors are just great and soothing. Bumping up.', '2004-12-15 21:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064956, 126979, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>How sad. This is a universal experience which the human heart subjects itself because it chooses to love.  A minor fault is the grain which detracts from the arms. However, the image is moving and the composition is to be admired. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:How sad. This is a universal experience which the human heart subjects itself because it chooses to love.  A minor fault is the grain which detracts from the arms. However, the image is moving and the composition is to be admired. Bumping up.', '2004-12-15 21:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064959, 127866, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>Love the lavendar, purple and lilac. Yep, this is broken and it is a very nice capture.Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:Love the lavendar, purple and lilac. Yep, this is broken and it is a very nice capture.Bumping up.', '2004-12-15 21:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064962, 127919, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>Very nice pose and great sepia tones. The solemn concept may have been heightened by showing the hair a little more out of composure. Otherwise, the image does manage to convey enough of the feeling. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:Very nice pose and great sepia tones. The solemn concept may have been heightened by showing the hair a little more out of composure. Otherwise, the image does manage to convey enough of the feeling. Bumping up.', '2004-12-15 21:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064967, 128001, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>Interesting effect and a very good macro. It is like an idea that leaves the viewer hanging. Something haunting about it and worthy of further exploration. In short, a very good root idea. Bumping up on creativity.</td>', 'Returning for comments:Interesting effect and a very good macro. It is like an idea that leaves the viewer hanging. Something haunting about it and worthy of further exploration. In short, a very good root idea. Bumping up on creativity.', '2004-12-15 21:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064968, 126640, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>Great lighting and expert capture. The sepia treatment seeks anf gets credits. The dof is on the money. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:Great lighting and expert capture. The sepia treatment seeks anf gets credits. The dof is on the money. Bumping up.', '2004-12-15 21:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
