(1065046, 127900, 16829, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites because of the lighting, composition, and a very pleasing blend of colors and textures.</td>', 'One of my favorites because of the lighting, composition, and a very pleasing blend of colors and textures.', '2004-12-15 22:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
