(1065088, 127633, 29269, '<td valign="top">I like how the ''brokenness'' is implied, and not shown here. Updating to 7 after going through most images.</td>', 'I like how the ''brokenness'' is implied, and not shown here. Updating to 7 after going through most images.', '2004-12-15 23:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065092, 127664, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>More like broken palace and broken spirit. One of those true life captures that deliver a deep message regarding mortality and the passing of time along with all joys and broken dreams. The semi prostate figures on the lower left give this image not only a spatial sense but also a peek into the abyss of the soul. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:More like broken palace and broken spirit. One of those true life captures that deliver a deep message regarding mortality and the passing of time along with all joys and broken dreams. The semi prostate figures on the lower left give this image not only a spatial sense but also a peek into the abyss of the soul. Bumping up.', '2004-12-15 23:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065094, 127910, 29269, '<td valign="top">What puzzles me with this image is the straight line of the cut. I haven''t seen a broken LP in a long time, so I can''t remember if they break on such straight lines in reality, but this one seemed so unreal.<br/>Also, I could see the tripod and you taking the picture in the reflection off of the arm... and I wish it wasn''t there.</td>', 'What puzzles me with this image is the straight line of the cut. I haven''t seen a broken LP in a long time, so I can''t remember if they break on such straight lines in reality, but this one seemed so unreal.Also, I could see the tripod and you taking the picture in the reflection off of the arm... and I wish it wasn''t there.', '2004-12-15 23:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065100, 127610, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>A great shot with ample spatial overhead. The tones add interest along with the sky. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:A great shot with ample spatial overhead. The tones add interest along with the sky. Bumping up.', '2004-12-15 23:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065117, 127341, 28003, '<td valign="top">Great colors.</td>', 'Great colors.', '2004-12-15 23:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065120, 127862, 28003, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot - looks a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Terrific shot - looks a bit oversharpened.', '2004-12-15 23:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065123, 127661, 28003, '<td valign="top">Not the best composition, and not terribly exciting. Sorry.</td>', 'Not the best composition, and not terribly exciting. Sorry.', '2004-12-15 23:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065132, 127893, 29269, '<td valign="top">I like the idea! (Of course, since I had a similar shot in this challenge, almost identically titled). It seems that the ring could have been more in focus.</td>', 'I like the idea! (Of course, since I had a similar shot in this challenge, almost identically titled). It seems that the ring could have been more in focus.', '2004-12-15 23:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065137, 128003, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>A very fine b/w study with great texture and tonal balance. The lighting keeps the eyes centered but many fine rewards to be found wandering about this image. 7</td>', 'Returning for comments:A very fine b/w study with great texture and tonal balance. The lighting keeps the eyes centered but many fine rewards to be found wandering about this image. 7', '2004-12-16 00:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065143, 127475, 29269, '<td valign="top">Well, it seems that the checkbox will remain unchecked after this challenge. Whenever you use a frame, it tends to polarize the audience - some love it and some hate it. I don''t think that this particular image needed framing, but I kind of like the choice of the frame color. The topic corresponds to the challenge. I''d go with a 7 for this one.</td>', 'Well, it seems that the checkbox will remain unchecked after this challenge. Whenever you use a frame, it tends to polarize the audience - some love it and some hate it. I don''t think that this particular image needed framing, but I kind of like the choice of the frame color. The topic corresponds to the challenge. I''d go with a 7 for this one.', '2004-12-16 00:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065146, 127925, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>Very nice technique. The employment of a hand slapping it on the surface may have added a sense of immediacy. However, that is another image. Bumping up on good comp and lighting.</td>', 'Returning for comments:Very nice technique. The employment of a hand slapping it on the surface may have added a sense of immediacy. However, that is another image. Bumping up on good comp and lighting.', '2004-12-16 00:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065200, 127871, 30550, '<td valign="top">Great use of lines and patterns.  Nice focus throughout - I like how the light reflects off of the breaks in the glass.</td>', 'Great use of lines and patterns.  Nice focus throughout - I like how the light reflects off of the breaks in the glass.', '2004-12-16 00:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065224, 127927, 28003, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Great lighting, and an interesting story being told.</td>', 'Fantastic. Great lighting, and an interesting story being told.', '2004-12-16 01:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065226, 127974, 28003, '<td valign="top">Might work a little better if the foreground cable were a little more visible. Also perhaps clear away some of the leaves.</td>', 'Might work a little better if the foreground cable were a little more visible. Also perhaps clear away some of the leaves.', '2004-12-16 01:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065227, 127863, 28003, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, decent composition, striking use of color, and it fits well with the challenge.</td>', 'Good lighting, decent composition, striking use of color, and it fits well with the challenge.', '2004-12-16 01:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065229, 127981, 28003, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... cute, but not that appealing. Sorry.</td>', 'Hmmm... cute, but not that appealing. Sorry.', '2004-12-16 01:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065230, 127929, 28003, '<td valign="top">Might work a little better if it were clearler what the broken object is. As it stands, the fish is the focal point... and the broken object is merely an aside.</td>', 'Might work a little better if it were clearler what the broken object is. As it stands, the fish is the focal point... and the broken object is merely an aside.', '2004-12-16 01:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
