(1066187, 127795, 24976, '<td valign="top">this shot didnt need to be isolated in black... it would have been a lot more interesting in an everyday kitchen scene or something similar.</td>', 'this shot didnt need to be isolated in black... it would have been a lot more interesting in an everyday kitchen scene or something similar.', '2004-12-16 17:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066195, 127442, 24976, '<td valign="top">coool. the composition works very well, the green expecially in the upper left is beginning to look a bit cut out like but excellence in the rest of the photo makes up for it. 9</td>', 'coool. the composition works very well, the green expecially in the upper left is beginning to look a bit cut out like but excellence in the rest of the photo makes up for it. 9', '2004-12-16 17:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066204, 126448, 23394, '<td valign="top">very, very creative.  love the composition, lighting, and negative space.  good work!<br/> <br/>Composition: 10, Technical: 8, Appeal: 10, Challenge: 10, Overall Calculated Average Score: 10</td>', 'very, very creative.  love the composition, lighting, and negative space.  good work! Composition: 10, Technical: 8, Appeal: 10, Challenge: 10, Overall Calculated Average Score: 10', '2004-12-16 17:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066208, 127855, 23394, '<td valign="top">i think the main thing that bothers me about this image is the transition of color between the color created by the lighting and the natural color of the yellow part of the yolk, as well as the lack of warmth in the lighting to the left.  all in all, this is an above average effort.  good luck!<br/> <br/>Composition: 7, Technical: 8, Appeal: 7, Challenge: 10, Overall Calculated Average Score: 8<br/> <br/></td>', 'i think the main thing that bothers me about this image is the transition of color between the color created by the lighting and the natural color of the yellow part of the yolk, as well as the lack of warmth in the lighting to the left.  all in all, this is an above average effort.  good luck! Composition: 7, Technical: 8, Appeal: 7, Challenge: 10, Overall Calculated Average Score: 8 ', '2004-12-16 17:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066213, 127351, 23394, '<td valign="top">Composition: 7 - a little to tightly cropped, Technical: 4 - i could overlook the soft focus, but you really did a sloppy job on the editing, Appeal: 8 - it gave me a grin, Challenge: 10, Overall Calculated Average Score: 7<br/> <br/>all in all, a good entry, above average.  i just hope you didn''t break the bank just for the sake of the challenge ;-)</td>', 'Composition: 7 - a little to tightly cropped, Technical: 4 - i could overlook the soft focus, but you really did a sloppy job on the editing, Appeal: 8 - it gave me a grin, Challenge: 10, Overall Calculated Average Score: 7 all in all, a good entry, above average.  i just hope you didn''t break the bank just for the sake of the challenge ;-)', '2004-12-16 17:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066216, 127347, 23394, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8, nicely organized<br/>Technical: 8, dof drops off a bit<br/>Appeal: 8, a little on the dark side, but acceptable<br/>Challenge: 10, dead-on.  beats the heck out of light bulbs!<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 9, above average, for sure.  solid piece of work.  good luck!</td>', 'Composition: 8, nicely organizedTechnical: 8, dof drops off a bitAppeal: 8, a little on the dark side, but acceptableChallenge: 10, dead-on.  beats the heck out of light bulbs!Overall Calculated Average Score: 9, above average, for sure.  solid piece of work.  good luck!', '2004-12-16 17:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066225, 127256, 23394, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5, fairly dead on<br/>Technical: 6, while nothing in the shot is out of place, it also doesn''t look like it challenged you too much from a technical standpoint<br/>Appeal: 6, i have mixed feelings about the colors.  i don''t think the desat is particularly effective here.  it''s not really grabbing me.<br/>Challenge: 8, while the image has broken windows in it, the way you have treated tends to highlight the stonework as the primary subject.  as is, the broken glass is competing (and in my opinion, losing) to the wall.<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 6, the one thing that makes this above average for me is the textures that you''ve captured.  good luck!</td>', 'Composition: 5, fairly dead onTechnical: 6, while nothing in the shot is out of place, it also doesn''t look like it challenged you too much from a technical standpointAppeal: 6, i have mixed feelings about the colors.  i don''t think the desat is particularly effective here.  it''s not really grabbing me.Challenge: 8, while the image has broken windows in it, the way you have treated tends to highlight the stonework as the primary subject.  as is, the broken glass is competing (and in my opinion, losing) to the wall.Overall Calculated Average Score: 6, the one thing that makes this above average for me is the textures that you''ve captured.  good luck!', '2004-12-16 17:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066227, 127660, 23394, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5, there''s nothing really wrong here, but shooting straight on from eye level doesn''t make it that interesting<br/>Technical: 7, nothing really off here.  it''s just too bad the colors don''t really stand out more<br/>Appeal: 5, this doesn''t really move me one way or another<br/>Challenge: 5, i''ll have to take your word for it that this is broken.  your image conveys more of a sense of old than broken (actually, from the look of the bin, it looks like it is still in use...)<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 6</td>', 'Composition: 5, there''s nothing really wrong here, but shooting straight on from eye level doesn''t make it that interestingTechnical: 7, nothing really off here.  it''s just too bad the colors don''t really stand out moreAppeal: 5, this doesn''t really move me one way or anotherChallenge: 5, i''ll have to take your word for it that this is broken.  your image conveys more of a sense of old than broken (actually, from the look of the bin, it looks like it is still in use...)Overall Calculated Average Score: 6', '2004-12-16 17:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066233, 127604, 23394, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8, great angle<br/>Technical: 4, focus really needs to be spot on.  also, the back edge of the shooting surface is a distraction.  the lighting could use some work, as well.  maybe try a different white balance setting?<br/>Appeal: 9, love it!!!<br/>Challenge: 10, dead on!<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 8, this is a shot with potential.  i would really recommend revisiting it after the challenge.  if you cleaned it up the right way, you''d have a saleable print.</td>', 'Composition: 8, great angleTechnical: 4, focus really needs to be spot on.  also, the back edge of the shooting surface is a distraction.  the lighting could use some work, as well.  maybe try a different white balance setting?Appeal: 9, love it!!!Challenge: 10, dead on!Overall Calculated Average Score: 8, this is a shot with potential.  i would really recommend revisiting it after the challenge.  if you cleaned it up the right way, you''d have a saleable print.', '2004-12-16 17:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
