(1066282, 127958, 23394, '<td valign="top">Composition: 6, lines and curves are interesting.  like the textures and the lighting<br/>Technical: 5, wish the whole fish had been in focus.  if you intended a shallow dof, fine, but i don''t understand why you would do that.<br/>Appeal: 5, i can take it or leave it.  i can appreciate it for what it is and the way you''ve captured it, but, all the same, it''s not anything i''d hang on my wall.<br/>Challenge: 1, sorry, but you blew it here.  i see nothing broken.  dead, yes, broken, no.<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 4, nice effort, good luck!</td>', 'Composition: 6, lines and curves are interesting.  like the textures and the lightingTechnical: 5, wish the whole fish had been in focus.  if you intended a shallow dof, fine, but i don''t understand why you would do that.Appeal: 5, i can take it or leave it.  i can appreciate it for what it is and the way you''ve captured it, but, all the same, it''s not anything i''d hang on my wall.Challenge: 1, sorry, but you blew it here.  i see nothing broken.  dead, yes, broken, no.Overall Calculated Average Score: 4, nice effort, good luck!', '2004-12-16 18:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
