(1066519, 127356, 22479, '<td valign="top">Revisiting. <br/> <br/>This image has a moody, surreal feel to it with your given choice of lighting/hue adjustment. At first, I quickly skimmed passed this shot as another broken bulb shot. However, I can see the connection between your title and shot (lightbulb = moment of inspiring thought). Well done. This image is beyond reproach from a technical point of view, except for one small area on the screw that appears to have been burned a bit to perhaps reduce a blow out (a bit distracting loss of detail). Does not take away much from the quality of this shot, however. I am raising this one up from 4 -&gt; 7.</td>', 'Revisiting.  This image has a moody, surreal feel to it with your given choice of lighting/hue adjustment. At first, I quickly skimmed passed this shot as another broken bulb shot. However, I can see the connection between your title and shot (lightbulb = moment of inspiring thought). Well done. This image is beyond reproach from a technical point of view, except for one small area on the screw that appears to have been burned a bit to perhaps reduce a blow out (a bit distracting loss of detail). Does not take away much from the quality of this shot, however. I am raising this one up from 4 -> 7.', '2004-12-16 22:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066544, 127065, 164, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and good use of color contrast.</td>', 'Interesting subject and good use of color contrast.', '2004-12-16 23:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
