(1067479, 126932, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>A very good find for this challenge and captured very well in its own environment. The dilapidated condition is ideal to impart this great texture. It is an image that speaks of age and of a time long past. A very good study for this challenge. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:A very good find for this challenge and captured very well in its own environment. The dilapidated condition is ideal to impart this great texture. It is an image that speaks of age and of a time long past. A very good study for this challenge. Bumping up.', '2004-12-17 20:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
