(1067488, 127979, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>This is a great concept and I wonder about some variations to make the image sing a little louder.  The blanket is neat, his hair is neat and so the assumption here is not broken because of poverty but rather other implications such as a broken home, etc. My gut feeling with this model is to have him sit, frown and hold his hand over his temples looking totally depressed. However, this is another picture.<br/> <br/>As is it is a good photograph and very well composed but lacking that sensation of broken. In its own tight it does have an appeal and that is why U commented on it. 6</td>', 'Returning for comments:This is a great concept and I wonder about some variations to make the image sing a little louder.  The blanket is neat, his hair is neat and so the assumption here is not broken because of poverty but rather other implications such as a broken home, etc. My gut feeling with this model is to have him sit, frown and hold his hand over his temples looking totally depressed. However, this is another picture. As is it is a good photograph and very well composed but lacking that sensation of broken. In its own tight it does have an appeal and that is why U commented on it. 6', '2004-12-17 20:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
