(1067767, 127958, 22970, '<td valign="top">I like your shot because it has emotion behind it while having good detail. I like the B&amp;W you have used and the photo is technically sound. I think we need more photographs on this site that shows emotion not just technically sound photos with no meaning behind it. Good Shot!</td>', 'I like your shot because it has emotion behind it while having good detail. I like the B&W you have used and the photo is technically sound. I think we need more photographs on this site that shows emotion not just technically sound photos with no meaning behind it. Good Shot!', '2004-12-18 03:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067770, 128010, 22970, '<td valign="top">Ok I can see the link between your title and photograph. While technically sound I find it more distracting. I may be the odd ball out but I dont see any emotion in the photograph. Just a picture of broken reflections [imo], however not everyone feels the same way about a photograph. I feel you have done a good job of meeting the challenge so I score your photograph a 5. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok I can see the link between your title and photograph. While technically sound I find it more distracting. I may be the odd ball out but I dont see any emotion in the photograph. Just a picture of broken reflections [imo], however not everyone feels the same way about a photograph. I feel you have done a good job of meeting the challenge so I score your photograph a 5. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-12-18 03:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067775, 127664, 22970, '<td valign="top">This is what separates a photo from a photograph in my opinion. We were asked to do our best in representing broken and I have seen so may photos of everyday objects broken but with no emotion or story behind it. I believe a photograph should have a story and emotion behind it or its just a snap shot or photograph that one is trying to appeal to the mass with good technique. I feel you have met the challenge with emotion and a story and at the same time being technically great. I hope others can learn along with myself that something needs to be behind the photograph we submit. Great Job and a well deserved 10.</td>', 'This is what separates a photo from a photograph in my opinion. We were asked to do our best in representing broken and I have seen so may photos of everyday objects broken but with no emotion or story behind it. I believe a photograph should have a story and emotion behind it or its just a snap shot or photograph that one is trying to appeal to the mass with good technique. I feel you have met the challenge with emotion and a story and at the same time being technically great. I hope others can learn along with myself that something needs to be behind the photograph we submit. Great Job and a well deserved 10.', '2004-12-18 04:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067776, 127865, 22970, '<td valign="top">Again like I commented on another photograph you have met the challenge with a story and emotion behind it, which we all should strive to do.  Focus is a little soft; I would of like to have seen it sharper and maybe in a duotone color or B&amp;W but I like the crop. I think you have done a good job and a well deserved 6.</td>', 'Again like I commented on another photograph you have met the challenge with a story and emotion behind it, which we all should strive to do.  Focus is a little soft; I would of like to have seen it sharper and maybe in a duotone color or B&W but I like the crop. I think you have done a good job and a well deserved 6.', '2004-12-18 04:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
