(1068614, 127346, 13749, '<td valign="top">perhaps cut the fingernails, since you can''t help but look at them when you try to look at the face.  no idea how you did this, but VERY creative interpretation.</td>', 'perhaps cut the fingernails, since you can''t help but look at them when you try to look at the face.  no idea how you did this, but VERY creative interpretation.', '2004-12-19 02:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068616, 127474, 13749, '<td valign="top">ouch.  i hope this thing was broken ahead of time<br/> <br/>if not, i think you''ve reached a new level of "what people will do for challenges".  perhaps a tripod and some tweaking in photoshop would''ve increased sharpness and made the colors pop.</td>', 'ouch.  i hope this thing was broken ahead of time if not, i think you''ve reached a new level of "what people will do for challenges".  perhaps a tripod and some tweaking in photoshop would''ve increased sharpness and made the colors pop.', '2004-12-19 02:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068617, 127599, 13749, '<td valign="top">ooohh, i like it - very interesting interpretation and good find - i would also like this if it weren''t for the challenge.  too bad that white line intersects the thread, cuz that distracts me for some reason.  either way, nice shot!</td>', 'ooohh, i like it - very interesting interpretation and good find - i would also like this if it weren''t for the challenge.  too bad that white line intersects the thread, cuz that distracts me for some reason.  either way, nice shot!', '2004-12-19 02:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068618, 127266, 13749, '<td valign="top">very clean cut, which makes it even more interesting.  normally i would want the broken object to be in focus, but for some reason this seems to work as well.  very compelling and orderly looking (unnatural) arrangement, which i might not normally like but works well for this shot.  some sharpness and color tweaking could''ve really made this one POP.</td>', 'very clean cut, which makes it even more interesting.  normally i would want the broken object to be in focus, but for some reason this seems to work as well.  very compelling and orderly looking (unnatural) arrangement, which i might not normally like but works well for this shot.  some sharpness and color tweaking could''ve really made this one POP.', '2004-12-19 02:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068619, 127988, 13749, '<td valign="top">great subject and shot, i really like it - surprised there aren''t more junker cars in this challenge.  your DOF choice seems like you may have found the windshield the most interesting, and i think i agree.  i''m curious if you got any interesting angles/shots of the windshield on its own - they could make for some great images!</td>', 'great subject and shot, i really like it - surprised there aren''t more junker cars in this challenge.  your DOF choice seems like you may have found the windshield the most interesting, and i think i agree.  i''m curious if you got any interesting angles/shots of the windshield on its own - they could make for some great images!', '2004-12-19 02:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068621, 127614, 13749, '<td valign="top">nice background color that works well for this subject.  your title adds quite a bit more to this photo than i would normally interpret, so kudos on that.</td>', 'nice background color that works well for this subject.  your title adds quite a bit more to this photo than i would normally interpret, so kudos on that.', '2004-12-19 02:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068622, 127347, 13749, '<td valign="top">haha - i just saw another broken cork in the challenge not long ago and commented "i hate when that happens".  anyways, i DO hate when that happens - but, interesting image and angle.   perhaps a slightly cleaner/less dusty opener would''ve helped here, but it''s still a strong image.</td>', 'haha - i just saw another broken cork in the challenge not long ago and commented "i hate when that happens".  anyways, i DO hate when that happens - but, interesting image and angle.   perhaps a slightly cleaner/less dusty opener would''ve helped here, but it''s still a strong image.', '2004-12-19 02:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068623, 127832, 13749, '<td valign="top">creative interpretation, but i would''ve liked to see more focus and perhaps could''ve lost the big ''Racing Form'' sheet, as it doesn''t look too authentic - maybe some other things in the wallet could make it seem more used (an ID?).  either way, good idea.</td>', 'creative interpretation, but i would''ve liked to see more focus and perhaps could''ve lost the big ''Racing Form'' sheet, as it doesn''t look too authentic - maybe some other things in the wallet could make it seem more used (an ID?).  either way, good idea.', '2004-12-19 02:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068625, 127865, 13749, '<td valign="top">very creative interpretation and representation.  i especially like the slant that you''ve added to this shot, as i feel a completely horizontal image would''ve made it relatively boring.</td>', 'very creative interpretation and representation.  i especially like the slant that you''ve added to this shot, as i feel a completely horizontal image would''ve made it relatively boring.', '2004-12-19 02:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
