(1068630, 127017, 13749, '<td valign="top">this image has a very unique look and feel to it.  took me awhile to realize that the glass was broken (call me slow).  i might''ve preferred a different angle, but i have yet to produce an image with this feel, so i''ll leave that choice up to you ;)</td>', 'this image has a very unique look and feel to it.  took me awhile to realize that the glass was broken (call me slow).  i might''ve preferred a different angle, but i have yet to produce an image with this feel, so i''ll leave that choice up to you ;)', '2004-12-19 02:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
