(1068640, 127923, 13749, '<td valign="top">very interesting and beautiful.  people may complain that it looks a little blown out in the right section, but i guess it''s more detail than it would be in a indoor studio!   great find.</td>', 'very interesting and beautiful.  people may complain that it looks a little blown out in the right section, but i guess it''s more detail than it would be in a indoor studio!   great find.', '2004-12-19 02:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068643, 127872, 13749, '<td valign="top">looks like this doll has seen (no pun intended) better days.  great color and texure rendition, as well as good subject choice.  one of my favorites so far.</td>', 'looks like this doll has seen (no pun intended) better days.  great color and texure rendition, as well as good subject choice.  one of my favorites so far.', '2004-12-19 02:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068646, 127749, 22479, '<td valign="top">Quite a dark, disturbing theme, which fits, unfortunately, quite well with this challenge. I see that there are tall weeds which have sprouted about the door, and there is a lot of symbolism going on here. Quite creative.<br/> <br/>Technically, not quite refined given we''re using advanced editing. However, technical details should take a back seat to implied meaning in this type of photograph.</td>', 'Quite a dark, disturbing theme, which fits, unfortunately, quite well with this challenge. I see that there are tall weeds which have sprouted about the door, and there is a lot of symbolism going on here. Quite creative. Technically, not quite refined given we''re using advanced editing. However, technical details should take a back seat to implied meaning in this type of photograph.', '2004-12-19 02:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068657, 127516, 22479, '<td valign="top">This picture gives me the creeps. The bright area directly above the woman''s head appears ominous and threatening somehow. I don''t know what it is, and that perhaps contributes to it. The flat, emotionless expression on her face contributes as well. <br/> <br/>Overall I get a gestalt about this photo, but I cannot connect the dots, so to speak, as I am at a loss how to identify the specifics of exactly what you''re trying to convey. Maybe if I mull it over for an hour or two, I''ll be able to stumble across it. :)</td>', 'This picture gives me the creeps. The bright area directly above the woman''s head appears ominous and threatening somehow. I don''t know what it is, and that perhaps contributes to it. The flat, emotionless expression on her face contributes as well.  Overall I get a gestalt about this photo, but I cannot connect the dots, so to speak, as I am at a loss how to identify the specifics of exactly what you''re trying to convey. Maybe if I mull it over for an hour or two, I''ll be able to stumble across it. :)', '2004-12-19 02:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068666, 127888, 23478, '<td valign="top">I like this, the grey on grey and the angle make it a good photo.</td>', 'I like this, the grey on grey and the angle make it a good photo.', '2004-12-19 03:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068667, 127319, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent stop motion. Humorous title as well, and that always helps :)<br/> <br/>I think the near-square crop works well here. You framed it well.<br/> <br/>Technically, everything seems in order. Great sharpness, with only a hint of halos. The only thing that I would have done here is to selectively desaturate the red channel a bit, to remove that red glare off the screw.</td>', 'Excellent stop motion. Humorous title as well, and that always helps :) I think the near-square crop works well here. You framed it well. Technically, everything seems in order. Great sharpness, with only a hint of halos. The only thing that I would have done here is to selectively desaturate the red channel a bit, to remove that red glare off the screw.', '2004-12-19 03:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068669, 126761, 22479, '<td valign="top">I hope this is staged. Tough theme in this pic, but very appropriate. Great use of selective desat. Tastefully executed.</td>', 'I hope this is staged. Tough theme in this pic, but very appropriate. Great use of selective desat. Tastefully executed.', '2004-12-19 03:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068671, 127980, 22479, '<td valign="top">I hope this is not lost on too many DPC''ers. I think you did a creative job interpreting the theme. Perhaps the red channel is a bit oversaturated but doesn''t significantly detract from the quality of the picture. Well done.</td>', 'I hope this is not lost on too many DPC''ers. I think you did a creative job interpreting the theme. Perhaps the red channel is a bit oversaturated but doesn''t significantly detract from the quality of the picture. Well done.', '2004-12-19 03:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068673, 127484, 22479, '<td valign="top">Looks like a stroller in the ditch. Stark, contrast tastefully adjusted. I think this is an appropriate interpretation of the challenge. Wonder if a bit of toning could give this image more emotion, perhaps a steel blue. Of course I like it the way it is.</td>', 'Looks like a stroller in the ditch. Stark, contrast tastefully adjusted. I think this is an appropriate interpretation of the challenge. Wonder if a bit of toning could give this image more emotion, perhaps a steel blue. Of course I like it the way it is.', '2004-12-19 03:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068674, 127813, 22479, '<td valign="top">...a wreck''s perspective. I find this photograph to be wonderfully creative. Love the framing. Well done.</td>', '...a wreck''s perspective. I find this photograph to be wonderfully creative. Love the framing. Well done.', '2004-12-19 03:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068675, 128001, 22479, '<td valign="top">Appears to be glass. Quite interesting. Not sure how you set this up. Would love to read the explanation. Lighting is somewhat harsh. Gives this a raw, gritty feel overall, which I find to be effective.</td>', 'Appears to be glass. Quite interesting. Not sure how you set this up. Would love to read the explanation. Lighting is somewhat harsh. Gives this a raw, gritty feel overall, which I find to be effective.', '2004-12-19 03:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068678, 127991, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent creativity, and well executed. I like the framing and layout. The red color is appropriate for the theme and the message.  From a technical point of view, I wonder if a soft, diffused light source from directly overhead might have worked better in softening up or eliminating the shadows. The directional lighting from the right side is a bit harsh.</td>', 'Excellent creativity, and well executed. I like the framing and layout. The red color is appropriate for the theme and the message.  From a technical point of view, I wonder if a soft, diffused light source from directly overhead might have worked better in softening up or eliminating the shadows. The directional lighting from the right side is a bit harsh.', '2004-12-19 03:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068681, 127475, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very catchy presentation. :) <br/> <br/>I like the frame. Some I suspect will comment negatively on it. Overall the lighting was a bit problematic in this shot. The light is a bit harsh, and there''s quite a bit of fall-off, with resulting uneven illumination. Colors are vibrant in the foreground, but along with the light, fades away.</td>', 'Very catchy presentation. :)  I like the frame. Some I suspect will comment negatively on it. Overall the lighting was a bit problematic in this shot. The light is a bit harsh, and there''s quite a bit of fall-off, with resulting uneven illumination. Colors are vibrant in the foreground, but along with the light, fades away.', '2004-12-19 03:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068682, 127804, 22479, '<td valign="top">That''s 7 years bad luck for you! :P<br/> <br/>Nice composition. Agree with title. I think the border works very well here.</td>', 'That''s 7 years bad luck for you! :P Nice composition. Agree with title. I think the border works very well here.', '2004-12-19 03:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068691, 127600, 22479, '<td valign="top">Clever presentation and wonderfully creative! Scores well artistically, and there is nothing that I would suggest for improvement, technically.<br/> <br/>One other comment. I wonder how this would look against an orange or yellow-orange backdrop...or perhaps an ivory backdrop. I think the red works, but to me it clashes with the theme of redemption.</td>', 'Clever presentation and wonderfully creative! Scores well artistically, and there is nothing that I would suggest for improvement, technically. One other comment. I wonder how this would look against an orange or yellow-orange backdrop...or perhaps an ivory backdrop. I think the red works, but to me it clashes with the theme of redemption.', '2004-12-19 03:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068693, 127602, 22479, '<td valign="top">What a horrific scene. I say the passengers are lucky to be alive. The flipped car is missing its wheels. Photo fits well with this theme, unfortunately. Sharp and well exposed.</td>', 'What a horrific scene. I say the passengers are lucky to be alive. The flipped car is missing its wheels. Photo fits well with this theme, unfortunately. Sharp and well exposed.', '2004-12-19 03:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068694, 127971, 22479, '<td valign="top">Clever title and nice composition. I think you handled the exposure on this image quite nicely, given the bright reflection off the surface of the water.</td>', 'Clever title and nice composition. I think you handled the exposure on this image quite nicely, given the bright reflection off the surface of the water.', '2004-12-19 04:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068695, 127994, 22479, '<td valign="top">The proof, as they say, is in the pudding! Clever execution and overall well composed here.<br/> <br/>Suggestion for improvement: the green tree ''branch'' is somewhat subdued. A quick hue/saturation adjustment to adjust the saturation of the green channel would give this image more pop and match the excellent saturation in the rest of the photograph. <br/> <br/>Overall a very refreshingly creative entry. Well done.</td>', 'The proof, as they say, is in the pudding! Clever execution and overall well composed here. Suggestion for improvement: the green tree ''branch'' is somewhat subdued. A quick hue/saturation adjustment to adjust the saturation of the green channel would give this image more pop and match the excellent saturation in the rest of the photograph.  Overall a very refreshingly creative entry. Well done.', '2004-12-19 04:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068698, 127373, 13749, '<td valign="top">although the pencils look properly colored, the background looks like it has some kind of yellow tint.  eliminate that either prior to shooting or in an editing program and you''d definitely gain a lot in appeal.</td>', 'although the pencils look properly colored, the background looks like it has some kind of yellow tint.  eliminate that either prior to shooting or in an editing program and you''d definitely gain a lot in appeal.', '2004-12-19 04:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068708, 128002, 28750, '<td valign="top">the photo is too small next time have it bigger</td>', 'the photo is too small next time have it bigger', '2004-12-19 05:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068711, 127256, 30861, '<td valign="top">Interesting desaturation of the wood, OR very kewl weathering. I wish the image were a little looser on the left, I don''t like the windowsill being nipped.</td>', 'Interesting desaturation of the wood, OR very kewl weathering. I wish the image were a little looser on the left, I don''t like the windowsill being nipped.', '2004-12-19 06:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068712, 128000, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''d be a LOT happier with this if the bumper weren''t picking up the magenta sos trongly, and especially if the license plate weren''t so pristine and obviously fake. Why one arth was that done, anyway?</td>', 'I''d be a LOT happier with this if the bumper weren''t picking up the magenta sos trongly, and especially if the license plate weren''t so pristine and obviously fake. Why one arth was that done, anyway?', '2004-12-19 06:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068713, 127560, 30861, '<td valign="top">Strong and intriguing conceptually. More attention to depth of field would be a plus here. the bottom of the check (unimportant) is sharper than the top of the check, and it hurts that the rightmost cookie is coming out of focus as well.</td>', 'Strong and intriguing conceptually. More attention to depth of field would be a plus here. the bottom of the check (unimportant) is sharper than the top of the check, and it hurts that the rightmost cookie is coming out of focus as well.', '2004-12-19 06:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068714, 127858, 30861, '<td valign="top">another decent scene marked down for poor contrast/weak lighting.</td>', 'another decent scene marked down for poor contrast/weak lighting.', '2004-12-19 06:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068715, 127475, 30861, '<td valign="top">A little self-promotion never hurt, eh? Or is that self-motivation?</td>', 'A little self-promotion never hurt, eh? Or is that self-motivation?', '2004-12-19 06:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068716, 128005, 30861, '<td valign="top">very sweet. perhaps a tad too centered for best effect?</td>', 'very sweet. perhaps a tad too centered for best effect?', '2004-12-19 06:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068717, 127866, 10047, '<td valign="top">Would have liked a deeper DOF. The orientation of the object leads the eye to the blurry end. Nice color and detail on the upper half.</td>', 'Would have liked a deeper DOF. The orientation of the object leads the eye to the blurry end. Nice color and detail on the upper half.', '2004-12-19 06:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068718, 127897, 30861, '<td valign="top">Expanding the tonal range would help a lot. The out-of-focus vertical on the left is a major flaw in this otherwise very appealing image.</td>', 'Expanding the tonal range would help a lot. The out-of-focus vertical on the left is a major flaw in this otherwise very appealing image.', '2004-12-19 06:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068719, 126935, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lovely. One presumes it''s an image of a work of art? Yours?</td>', 'Lovely. One presumes it''s an image of a work of art? Yours?', '2004-12-19 06:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068721, 127860, 30861, '<td valign="top">made me laugh</td>', 'made me laugh', '2004-12-19 06:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068722, 127948, 30861, '<td valign="top">a total nightmare</td>', 'a total nightmare', '2004-12-19 06:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068724, 126939, 10047, '<td valign="top">Hate when that hapens. I think i might have used a higher angle taking the shot to show more of the detail on the guitar.</td>', 'Hate when that hapens. I think i might have used a higher angle taking the shot to show more of the detail on the guitar.', '2004-12-19 06:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068725, 127484, 10047, '<td valign="top">Sort of a busy photo. My eye is drawn to many different objects. I might have cropped out the vehicle on the far right to try for less distraction.</td>', 'Sort of a busy photo. My eye is drawn to many different objects. I might have cropped out the vehicle on the far right to try for less distraction.', '2004-12-19 06:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068726, 127594, 10047, '<td valign="top">Sort of busy (trees, wires, poles), but I''m not sure if a different angle would have worked. I like the lighting and long shadows.</td>', 'Sort of busy (trees, wires, poles), but I''m not sure if a different angle would have worked. I like the lighting and long shadows.', '2004-12-19 06:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068729, 127374, 10047, '<td valign="top">I think I would have tried a background without texture, and not have the break as centered.</td>', 'I think I would have tried a background without texture, and not have the break as centered.', '2004-12-19 06:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068730, 127541, 10047, '<td valign="top">I think the photo needs more contrast. The colors seem washed out, and its a bit grainy. I might have tried moving the ring to a corner of the table and shooting from a different angle so there wasn''t so much table and chair.</td>', 'I think the photo needs more contrast. The colors seem washed out, and its a bit grainy. I might have tried moving the ring to a corner of the table and shooting from a different angle so there wasn''t so much table and chair.', '2004-12-19 06:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068732, 127982, 10047, '<td valign="top">The lighting a bit harsh and washing some of the detail out. I think I might have cropped the fence out.</td>', 'The lighting a bit harsh and washing some of the detail out. I think I might have cropped the fence out.', '2004-12-19 06:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068735, 127661, 10047, '<td valign="top">Would have like to see a little more DOF.</td>', 'Would have like to see a little more DOF.', '2004-12-19 06:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068736, 128000, 10047, '<td valign="top">WOW, thats bright. I might have tried not centering the car as much.</td>', 'WOW, thats bright. I might have tried not centering the car as much.', '2004-12-19 06:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
