(1069068, 127848, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is by far the best I''ve seen in this challenge to date, but it seems to me to be missing something.  I can''t put my finger on it.  It''s like I''m reading a story but an important chapter has been torn out.  You know it''s important, but you don''t know what it is...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is by far the best I''ve seen in this challenge to date, but it seems to me to be missing something.  I can''t put my finger on it.  It''s like I''m reading a story but an important chapter has been torn out.  You know it''s important, but you don''t know what it is...TC', '2004-12-19 16:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069074, 128002, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is one of the nicest ''way to small'' photos I''ve ever seen.  Too bad it isn''t big enough to see!<br/>TC<br/>PS:  In case no one else has offered to help, PM me after challenge and I''ll help ya with sizing issues!</td>', 'This is one of the nicest ''way to small'' photos I''ve ever seen.  Too bad it isn''t big enough to see!TCPS:  In case no one else has offered to help, PM me after challenge and I''ll help ya with sizing issues!', '2004-12-19 16:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069076, 127806, 9906, '<td valign="top">I actually like the shot, but do not understand what is supposed to be said with the selective desat.  It doesn''t seem to fit the image or the title.  It''s an element that doesn''t make sense.<br/>TC</td>', 'I actually like the shot, but do not understand what is supposed to be said with the selective desat.  It doesn''t seem to fit the image or the title.  It''s an element that doesn''t make sense.TC', '2004-12-19 16:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
