(1069211, 127251, 6999, '<td valign="top">Is this about editing or photography? I can''t decide, for myself. The base photo is OK, but it''s difficult to say that the impact of the shot is not primarily down to that motion blurring - and why doesn''t it affect the radiator grill, and the badge, and the headlamps ... sorry, I don''t like it.</td>', 'Is this about editing or photography? I can''t decide, for myself. The base photo is OK, but it''s difficult to say that the impact of the shot is not primarily down to that motion blurring - and why doesn''t it affect the radiator grill, and the badge, and the headlamps ... sorry, I don''t like it.', '2004-12-19 19:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
