(1069250, 127957, 25468, '<td valign="top">You had a double meaning here, I like that. I don''t like the look of the grass on the side. It just looks weird. Great job anyway.</td>', 'You had a double meaning here, I like that. I don''t like the look of the grass on the side. It just looks weird. Great job anyway.', '2004-12-19 20:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069252, 127866, 25468, '<td valign="top">I didn''t like this. To me it was too confusing (too close for me to see what it is clearly). I also didn''t like the giant glare off to the left. I do on the other hand like the colors you were able to get.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I didn''t like this. To me it was too confusing (too close for me to see what it is clearly). I also didn''t like the giant glare off to the left. I do on the other hand like the colors you were able to get. ', '2004-12-19 20:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
