(1070254, 127082, 14386, '<td valign="top">Many many thanks for the votes...i didn''t expect to ribbon as there are many beautiful shots.  I am here now in the Philippines for a vacation.  This is a great Christmas present to me. Salamat.<br/> <br/>Manny</td>', 'Many many thanks for the votes...i didn''t expect to ribbon as there are many beautiful shots.  I am here now in the Philippines for a vacation.  This is a great Christmas present to me. Salamat. Manny', '2004-12-20 08:59:22.000000', NULL, 0),
