(1070960, 127346, 16488, '<td valign="top">Having another good week, I see.  Congratulations on a well-deserved blue!<br/>Edit to add: That is one of the weirdest voting break-downs I''ve ever seen!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-20 16:11:58.</i></td>', 'Having another good week, I see.  Congratulations on a well-deserved blue!Edit to add: That is one of the weirdest voting break-downs I''ve ever seen!', '2004-12-20 16:11:09.000000', '2004-12-20 16:11:58.000000', 0),
(1071007, 127346, 20941, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Daniel for your Blue Ribbon for this great image. Creatively and technically this is a winner! WOW!!</td>', 'Congratulations Daniel for your Blue Ribbon for this great image. Creatively and technically this is a winner! WOW!!', '2004-12-20 16:37:45.000000', NULL, 0),
