(1076344, 126890, 18191, '<td valign="top">In response to my self-portrait --- I think that your shot beats mine by a LONGSHOT! I really like the mood portrayed here and how the heart offsets the rest of the photograph. Really brilliant and this is just one of the examples where DPC voters overlook great artistic ability.</td>', 'In response to my self-portrait --- I think that your shot beats mine by a LONGSHOT! I really like the mood portrayed here and how the heart offsets the rest of the photograph. Really brilliant and this is just one of the examples where DPC voters overlook great artistic ability.', '2004-12-24 10:12:57.000000', NULL, 0),
