(1668396, 127850, 24013, '<td valign="top">so much to look at and explore in this shot.  i love the way the background is lined up with the frame of the broken window.  and that bit of reflection really works well to give more context.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-02 07:17:13.</i></td>', 'so much to look at and explore in this shot.  i love the way the background is lined up with the frame of the broken window.  and that bit of reflection really works well to give more context.', '2005-09-02 08:16:11.000000', '2005-09-02 08:17:13.000000', 0),
