(1718162, 127505, 18738, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this didn''t do better. I love it, but as you probably worked out it isn''t quite glossy enough to score well(don''t get me wrong I like glossy too).<br/> <br/>As you say that every aspect of the shot was intentional I think you succeeded admirably in what you set out to do. <br/> <br/>Looking at it a bit longer, I think that there is a deep cruelty and pathos here that would probably stop me from hanging this up.</td>', 'I''m surprised this didn''t do better. I love it, but as you probably worked out it isn''t quite glossy enough to score well(don''t get me wrong I like glossy too). As you say that every aspect of the shot was intentional I think you succeeded admirably in what you set out to do.  Looking at it a bit longer, I think that there is a deep cruelty and pathos here that would probably stop me from hanging this up.', '2005-09-18 09:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
